      "name": "Spell-Like Abilities",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/magic-swirl.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>At will—entangle (DC 13), speak with plants, tree shape; 3/day—charm person (DC 13), deep slumber (DC 15), tree stride; 1/day—suggestion (DC 15). 6th-level caster. The save DCs are Wisdom-based.</p>",
